/E (The objective of this project is to develop a modern and responsive web application that allows users to explore movies and TV shows using the TMDB \(The Movie Database\) API. The application enables users to search for movies and TV series, view detailed information, watch official trailers, apply filters such as genre, year, rating, and popularity, and create a personalized watchlist. The project aims to provide a user-friendly interface with fast performance, responsive design, and an engaging browsing experience similar to popular streaming platforms.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [32]
>>
